# .cache/ holds the content-hashed diagram and chart SVGs. It is COMMITTED on
# purpose: the renderers check the cache before invoking d2 or python3, so a
# populated cache lets the site build in environments that provide only a Go
# toolchain (Cloudflare Pages). Regenerate by deleting a file and rebuilding.
